<title>SPAIN: Spain presents plan to sell Gas Natural stake.</title>
<headline>Spain presents plan to sell Gas Natural stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>President of Spain's state industrial holding company SEPI Pedro Ferreras presented on Monday a detailed plan for selling the 3.8 percent stake in Gas Natural.</p>
<p>A note said the government will offer the shares to institutional investors both domestic and international.</p>
<p>The privatisation will be finalized before year end if market conditions permit. The plan was approved by SEPI's board on September 27.</p>
<p>Ferreras presented the plan to the advisory privatisation commitee, due to present a report before putting the program before the government for final approval.</p>
<p>- Madrid Newsroom 341-585-2160</p>
